WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.459 --> 00:00:05.459
Welcome to another Epic Games Unreal Engine training course.

2
00:00:05.459 --> 00:00:09.490
Today, the focus will be on Control Rig and Procedural Rigging.

3
00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:14.380
We'll be taking a look at what procedural rigging is in Unreal Engine,

4
00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:19.379
and getting a basic understanding of what it means to create a Control Rig procedurally.

5
00:00:19.379 --> 00:00:25.280
We'll then dig into the construction event and some new procedural rigging nodes and functions

6
00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:28.280
that we use to create these Control Rigs.

7
00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:32.700
And then go over a demo of building a simple FK rig procedurally

8
00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:36.109
using two slightly different methods.

9
00:00:36.109 --> 00:00:39.109
And very quickly, this is something you could use in your own project

10
00:00:39.109 --> 00:00:43.109
to create a simple FK rig that you'd be able to share across

11
00:00:43.109 --> 00:00:45.109
all of the skeletons within your project.

12
00:00:45.109 --> 00:00:50.299
We've included the project file so you can follow along as we go through the demo,

13
00:00:50.299 --> 00:00:54.299
so make sure you get that open and we can jump straight in.
